um acid carbonate, Wheat starch, Potato flour, Wheat malt, Salt, Flavourings.", "categories": "Biscotti al cioccolato al latte", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/800/304/001/4602/front_it.4.400.jpg", "nutrition": {"carbohydrates_100g": 66.9, "energy-kcal_100g": 466, "energy-kj_100g": 1958.1, "fat_100g": 18, "proteins_100g": 7.6, "sodium_100g": 0.24, "sugars_100g": 0.3}}, {"code": "6923555210455", "name": "orange juice", "brand": "汇源", "ingredients": "", "categories": "", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/692/355/521/0455/front_zh.4.400.jpg", "nutrition": {}}, {"code": "5400141107203", "name": "Crunchy Muesli", "brand": "Boni", "ingredients": "40,5 % flocons d'_avoine_ complète, 27 % fruits séchés, noix et graines (10 % raisins secs (raisins, huiles végétales (tournesol, graine de coton)), 4 % chips de banane cuits (bananes, huile de coco, sucre, arôme de banane), 3 % chips de coco toastés, 3 % morceaux de _noisettes_, 3% graines de tournesol, 2 % canneberges glycérinées (sucre, canneberges, humectant (glycérol), acidifiant (E330), huile de tournesol), 2 % morceaux de pomme séchée (pommes, acidifiant (E330), antioxydant (E220))), sucre, croustillant au riz (semoule de riz, farine de _blé_, sucre, malt d'_orge_, sel), huile de tournesol, farine de _blé_, sirop de glucose, miel, arôme naturel, cannelle, colorant (E150a), antioxydant (E306).", "categories": "Mueslis aux fruits", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/540/014/110/7203/front_fr.13.400.jpg", "nutrition": {"carbohydrates_100g": 61, "energy-kcal_100g": 441, "energy-kj_100g": 1829.9, "fat_100g": 17, "proteins_100g": 8.7, "sodium_100g": 0.04, "sugars_100g": 22}}, {"code": "11017024", "name": "Expresso Roast", "brand": "Starbucks", "ingredients": "", "categories": "", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/000/001/101/7024/front_zh.4.400.jpg", "nutrition": {}}, {"code": "6901209216374", "name": "优倍", "brand": "光明", "ingredients": "", "categories": "", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/690/120/921/6374/front_en.3.400.jpg", "nutrition": {}}, {"code": "6920180210614", "name": "Watsons water", "brand": "Watson’s", "ingredients": "", "categories": "Drinking water", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/692/018/021/0614/front_en.3.400.jpg", "nutrition": {}}, {"code": "5410231101127", "name": "Sucre vanille", "brand": "Dr. Oetker", "ingredients": "# 1 Dr.Oetker Ten minste houdbaar tot einde: A consommer de préférence avant fin: 08.27 L215 M06 Vanille smaak Suiker / Sucre goût Vanille Vanille Zandkoekjes: 60g suiker, 2 zakjes Dr. Oetker Vanillesmaak suiker, 1 zakje Dr. Oetker Backin, 250g bloem, 1 eidooier, 100 g boter, 3 eetlepels melk, 1 mespunt zout. Bloem, Backin en zout mengen. Suiker, 1 zakje vanillesuiker, 1 eidooier en melk toevoegen en mengen. Stukjes boter toevoegen en tot een glad deeg kneden. Ca. 1/2 uur in de koelkast zetten. Deeg uitrollen, koekjes uitsteken en op met bakpapier beklede bakplaat leggen. Ca. 10-15 min bakken in het midden van de oven (160°C). Na het bakken een zakje vanillesuiker over de koekjes strooien. Sablés à la Vanille: 60g de sucre, 2 sachets de sucre goût Vanille Dr. Oetker, 1 sachet de Backin Dr. Oetker, 250g de farine, 1 jaune d'œuf, 100g de beurre, 3 c. à s. de lait, 1 pincée de sel. Mélanger la farine, le Backin et le sel. Puis incorporer le sucre, 1 sachet de sucre vanille, le jaune d'œuf, le lait et mélanger. Ajouter les morceaux de beurre et pétrir jusqu'à obtention d'une pâte lisse. Mettre au frais pendant 1/2 heure. Etaler la pâte, découper les biscuits et les disposer sur la plaque de four couverte de papier sulfurisé. Cuire à mi - hauteur du four (160°C) 10-15 min. Après la cuisson, tamiser un sachet de sucre vanille sur les sablés. Recepten op www.oetker.be. Recettes sur www.oetker.be. Ingrediënten: Suiker, aroma (vanilline). Ingrédients: Sucre, arôme (vanilline). Koel en droog bewaren. A Conserver au sec et au frais. el.: 0800-90307 (gratis/gratuit) info@oetker.be s.a.br. Oetker n.v., De Kleetlaan 7B, bus 1, B-1831 Diegem Inhoud netto: / Poids net: 5 410231 10112 Z 13794 Mat.-Nr. 2-01-421609 8ge", "categories": "Sucres vanillés", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/541/023/110/1127/front_fr.4.400.jpg", "nutrition": {}}, {"code": "5400141187205", "name": "Thon au naturel", "brand": "", "ingredients": "", "categories": "Thons", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/540/014/118/7205/front_fr.4.400.jpg", "nutrition": {"carbohydrates_100g": 0.5, "energy-kcal_100g": 101, "energy-kj_100g": 429.1, "fat_100g": 0.8, "proteins_100g": 23, "sodium_100g": 0.3, "sugars_100g": 0.5}}, {"code": "6921355221411", "name": "Milk, whole", "brand": "Sanyuan", "ingredients": "", "categories": "", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/692/135/522/1411/front_zh.4.400.jpg", "nutrition": {"carbohydrates_100g": 4.8, "energy-kcal_100g": 66.2045888997, "fat_100g": 3.8, "proteins_100g": 3.2, "sodium_100g": 0.06}}, {"code": "6924743919235", "name": "Italian Red Meat Flavored Potato Chips", "brand": "Lay's", "ingredients": "Potato, soybean oil, Italian red meat (artificial) seasoning (soy sauce(soybean, wheat, salt, maltodextrin, caramel, disodium succinate, disodium guanylate, disodium inosinate, L-alanine), sugar, whey powder(milk), salt, MSG, ginger, maltodextrin, red pepper, artificial flavors, fructose, onion powder, silicon dioxide, citric acid, aspartame, disodium guanylate, disodium inosinate, colored with cochineal extract, steviol glycoside, neotame), TBHQ for freshness. contains wheat, soy, and phenylalanine\n\nUnknown quantity of Cadmium and Lead according to the State of California", "categories": "Potato crisps", "image": "https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/692/474/391/9235/front_en.15.400.jpg", "nutrition": {"carbohydrates_100g": 51.67, "energy-kcal_100g": 230, "energy-kj_100g": 2208.36, "fat_100g":